WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE
NOTE Demonstration captions for the PreTeXt "track" element.  These are not a
NOTE transcript of the film.  The text names the track, so that switching
NOTE tracks in the player's menu is visible to a reader, and so that the
NOTE "default" attribute on a sibling "track" can be seen to take effect.
NOTE All cues fall inside the 52-second trailer.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Track one: captions supplied by a "track" element.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Track one: the file is in Web Video Text Tracks (WebVTT) format.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Track one: "kind" is "subtitles" here; "captions" is the other choice.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Track one: "listing" gives the name shown in the player's menu.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Track one: "xml:lang" declares the language of these cues.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Track one: end of this track.
